-Lounge-1.ashx?rev=27caefe0605546c780ebf5aef846924e&amp;hash=9109320B574493FBB371820105266352\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/LoungeImages/Cairo-Alfursan-Lounge-2.ashx?rev=439bb9ef45d5450a9584f50c1ec2cd96&amp;hash=75258619F4C78A9D804130ED4D681711\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/LoungeImages/Cairo-Alfursan-Lounge-3.ashx?rev=e8fec00337724a7c83042500955ee244&amp;hash=3D7BC767277B5D47197892497C00FC98\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/LoungeImages/Cairo-Alfursan-Lounge-4.ashx?rev=56c35e0e31d64c9eb06e3daa326867c9&amp;hash=C0F8EA53048437D825DF6C7F28CB5AF9\">\n</div>\n<p>\nSAUDIA provides special lounges for its First and Business Class passengers, as well as, Alfursan Gold, Alfursan Silver and SkyTeam Elite Plus passengers.\nIn addition, special lounges are provided in some international airports through airline partners.\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Saudia Lounges Facilities:</h3>\n<div>\n<table class=\"full styled\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Airport Name / Lounge Name</th>\n            <th>Lounge Location / Hours of Operation</th>\n            <th>Facilities</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>Cairo International Airport /<br>\n            Saudia Lounge International</td>\n            <td>TB2, Cairo International Airport, Second Floor Building B / 24/7</td>\n            <td>\n            <em title=\"Hot Meal\" alt=\"Hot Meal\" class=\"hot_meal sv-icon\"></em>\n            <em title=\"Business Center\" alt=\"Business Center\" class=\"business_centre sv-icon\"></em>\n            <em title=\"Prayer Room\" alt=\"Prayer Room\" class=\"prayer sv-icon\"></em>\n            <em title=\"Smoking Room\" alt=\"Smoking Room\" class=\"smoking sv-icon\"></em>\n            <em title=\"Shower Facility\" alt=\"Shower Facility\" class=\"shower sv-icon\"></em>\n            <em title=\"Free Wifi\" alt=\"Free Wifi\" class=\"wifi sv-icon\"></em>\n            <em title=\"Access to Disabled\" alt=\"Access to Disabled\" class=\"disabled sv-icon\"></em><br>\n            Toilets (male/female), Seating area, Viewing area, Panoramic ramp view, Snack buffet (full day), Hot &amp; cold beverage\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3>Saudia lounges access fees:</h3>\n<p>\nSAUDIA opens its door for all guests to access Saudia lounges regardless of their travel class or Alfursan membership tier.\nIt is a perfect place to enjoy luxury, comfort and relaxation moments before the flight.\n</p>\n<div>\n<table>\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Airport</th>\n            <th>Lounge</th>\n            <th>SAUDIA Passengers Access Fee (Adult/Child)</th>\n            <th>Other Airlines Passengers Access Fee (Adult/Child)</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>CAI</td>\n            <td>International</td>\n            <td>140 / 70 SAR</td>\n            <td>200 / 100 SAR</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong>* Note:</strong> Lounge Access is subject to seat availability.</p>\n<p><strong>* Note:</strong> All prices are inclusive of VAT.</p></span><!----></p><!----></div><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-20 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-1\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-20 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><mat-tab-body role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mat-tab-body ng-tns-c3106391717-21 ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-tab-content-0-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-tab-label-0-2\"><div cdkscrollable=\"\" class=\"mat-tab-body-content ng-tns-c3106391717-21 ng-trigger ng-trigger-translateTab\"><!----></div></mat-tab-body><!----></div></mat-tab-group><!----></div></app-jss-tabs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-column